# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Diagramforce - PRODUCTION (GitHub Pages) repo
#
# ALLOWLIST. Everything is ignored unless it is named below, so a stray file in
# this folder stays private by default. Promotion is `npm run promote` in the
# dev repo, which copies only its SHIP list from a release tag. Keep the two in
# step: the script stops when this file would drop a file it ships.
#
# An ignore rule does NOT untrack a file that is already committed (that is how
# drive-icons.sketch stayed public from 1.19.3). After any edit here, this must
# print nothing:  git ls-files -ci --exclude-standard
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*
!/.gitignore
!/CNAME
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/DIAGRAM_JSON_SPEC.md
!/index.html
!/privacy.html
!/support.html
!/terms.html
!/manifest.json
!/sw.js
!/assets/
!/css/
!/js/
!/shapes/
!/templates/
!/how-to-use/
!/cowork-skill/

# Inside the shipped folders: the skill ships its package and bundle only
/cowork-skill/*
!/cowork-skill/diagramforce/
!/cowork-skill/diagramforce.skill

# Design sources stay private
*.sketch

# OS / editor noise, at any depth
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
